{"strongs": "H4509", "word": "מִיָּמִן", "translit": "min.ya.min", "root": "מי", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine 1.", "gloss": "priestly name:", "definition": "מִיָּמִן , מִיָּמִין , מִנְיָמִן , מִנְיָמִין proper name, masculine 1. priestly name: \\ \\ a. מִיָּמִן assigned to David's time, 1Chr 24:9 . \\ \\ b. Nehemiah's time Neh 10:8 = מִנְיָמִין Neh 12:17 ; Neh 12:41 . \\ \\ c. מִנְיָמִן assigned to Hezekiah's time 2Chr 31:15 . \\ \\ d. מִיָּמִין went up with Zerubbabel Neh 12:5 . 2. one of those who took strange wives Ezra 10:25 . — ᵐ5 Βενιαμειν and (especially A ᵐ5 L ) Μιαμειν .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4627')\">BDB4627</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4326')\">H4326</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H4509')\">H4509</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4626')\">BDB4626</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4628')\">BDB4628</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מִיָּמִן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מִיָּמִין</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מִנְיָמִן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מִנְיָמִין</bdbheb> <div class=\"point\"><b>proper name, masculine 1.</b> <highlightword>priestly name:</highlightword> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>מִיָּמִן</bdbheb> assigned to David's time, <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,9)\">1Chr 24:9</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> Nehemiah's time <ref ref=\"Neh 10:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,8)\">Neh 10:8</ref> = <bdbheb>מִנְיָמִין</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,17)\">Neh 12:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:41\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,41)\">Neh 12:41</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>מִנְיָמִן</bdbheb> assigned to Hezekiah's time <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,15)\">2Chr 31:15</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>מִיָּמִין</bdbheb> went up with Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"Neh 12:5\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,5)\">Neh 12:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> one of those who took strange wives <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:25\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,25)\">Ezra 10:25</ref>. — <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Βενιαμειν</grk> and (especially <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup>) <grk>Μιαμειν</grk>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Chr 24:9", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 24, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Neh 10:8", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 10, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Neh 12:17", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Neh 12:41", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 41}, {"raw": "2Chr 31:15", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 31, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Neh 12:5", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ezra 10:25", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 10, "verse": 25}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["מִיָּמִן", "מִיָּמִין", "מִנְיָמִן", "מִנְיָמִין", "ᵐ5"], "aramaic": [], "greek": ["Βενιαμειν", "Μιαμειν"], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["A", "Sept"]}, "covers": ["H4326", "H4509"], "bdbid": "BDB4627", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}